cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this research code, please cite it as below. A journal manuscript is in preparation; the citation will be updated on submission."
title: "Residual Correction Intent: State-Relative PET/CT Residual Correction"
abstract: >-
  Research code for state-conditioned executable correction programs (SCEP) in
  interactive whole-body PET/CT lesion segmentation. A sparse scribble plus the
  current mask and state are compiled into an object-referenced, grammar-legal
  correction program, learned state-relatively and without ground-truth access;
  the program then governs a constrained residual edit.
type: software
authors:
